{
 "cells": [
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# 03 – Transformation Pipeline (Issue #7)\n",
    "\n",
    "Notebook này minh họa cách sử dụng `src/cleaning_pipeline.py` – phần độc lập của Issue #7.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Lưu ý:** #5/#6 chưa hoàn thành. Notebook này dùng **fixture nhỏ** để demo.\n",
    "Khi #5/#6 merge xong, chỉ cần thay fixture bằng `pd.read_parquet('data/interim/...')`."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "import sys\n",
    "from pathlib import Path\n",
    "sys.path.insert(0, str(Path.cwd().parent / 'src'))\n",
    "\n",
    "import numpy as np\n    "import pandas as pd\n",
    "from cleaning_pipeline import (\n",
    "    add_cyclical_time_features,\n",
    "    chronological_split,\n",
    "    build_preprocessing_pipeline,\n",
    "    fit_pipeline_on_train,\n",
    "    transform_with_pipeline,\n",
    "    evaluate_log1p_transform,\n",
    "    merge_air_weather,\n",
    "    export_to_parquet,\n",
    "    freeze_dataset,\n",
    "    freeze_dataset_with_audit,\n",
    "    run_preprocessing_audit,\n",
    "    validate_no_leakage,\n",
    "    NUMERIC_FEATURES,\n",
    "    CYCLICAL_FEATURES,\n",
    ")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 1. Fixture nhỏ (demo – không phải dữ liệu thật)\n",
    "\n",
    "Tạo DataFrame mẫu để test pipeline. Khi #5/#6 xong, thay bằng data thật."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Fixture: 100 giờ, 1 trạm, có pm25 + số biến thời tiết\n",
    "rng = np.random.RandomState(42)\n",
    "n = 100\n",
    "\n",
    "df_air = pd.DataFrame({\n",
    "    'timestamp': pd.date_range('2024-01-01', periods=n, freq='h'),\n",
    "    'station_id': 'ST01',\n",
    "    'pm25': rng.lognormal(mean=3.5, sigma=0.8, size=n),\n",
    "    'pm10': rng.lognormal(mean=4.0, sigma=0.7, size=n),\n",
    "})\n",
    "\n",
    "df_weather = pd.DataFrame({\n",
    "    'timestamp': pd.date_range('2024-01-01', periods=n, freq='h'),\n",
    "    'station_id': 'ST01',\n",
    "    'temperature': rng.normal(25, 5, n),\n",
    "    'relative_humidity': rng.uniform(40, 95, n),\n",
    "    'wind_speed': rng.uniform(0, 10, n),\n",
    "    'wind_direction': rng.uniform(0, 360, n),\n",
    "    'precipitation': rng.exponential(2, n),\n",
    "    'surface_pressure': rng.normal(1013, 5, n),\n",
    "})\n",
    "\n",
    "print(f'Air: {df_air.shape}, Weather: {df_weather.shape}')\n",
    "df_air.head(3)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 2. Merge với row-explosion protection"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "df_merged = merge_air_weather(df_air, df_weather)\n",
    "print(f'Merged: {df_merged.shape}')\n",
    "assert len(df_merged) <= len(df_air), 'Row Explosion!'\n",
    "df_merged.head(3)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 3. Cyclical time features"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "df_merged = add_cyclical_time_features(df_merged)\n",
    "print('Cyclical features added:', CYCLICAL_FEATURES)\n",
    "df_merged[['timestamp', 'hour_sin', 'hour_cos', 'month_sin', 'month_cos']].head(3)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 4. Dataset freeze (ghi nhận metadata)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "freeze_info = freeze_dataset(df_merged)\n",
    "print(f'Rows: {freeze_info.row_count}')\n",
    "print(f'Span: {freeze_info.timestamp_min} → {freeze_info.timestamp_max}')\n",
    "print(f'Stations: {freeze_info.station_count}')"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 5. Chronological split (không random)\n",
    "\n",
    "Split point sẽ được quyết định sau khi #5/#6 hoàn thành.\n",
    "Ở đây demo với split tại 70% thời gian."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Demo split point – sẽ thay bằng giá trị thực tế sau #5/#6\n",
    "split_ts = df_merged['timestamp'].quantile(0.7)\n",
    "print(f'Split timestamp (demo): {split_ts}')\n",
    "\n",
    "train_df, test_df = chronological_split(df_merged, split_ts)\n",
    "print(f'Train: {len(train_df)}, Test: {len(test_df)}')\n",
    "\n",
    "# Validation cứng\n",
    "assert train_df['timestamp'].max() < test_df['timestamp'].min()\n",
    "print('✓ No temporal leakage')"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 6. Build & fit Pipeline (CHỈ trên Train)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Chọn features có trong fixture\n",
    "numeric_feats = [c for c in NUMERIC_FEATURES if c in train_df.columns]\n",
    "cyc_feats = [c for c in CYCLICAL_FEATURES if c in train_df.columns]\n",
    "\n",
    "print(f'Numeric: {numeric_feats}')\n",
    "print(f'Cyclical: {cyc_feats}')\n",
    "\n",
    "pipeline = build_preprocessing_pipeline(\n",
    "    numeric_features=numeric_feats,\n",
    "    cyclical_features=cyc_feats,\n",
    ")\n",
    "\n",
    "X_train = train_df[numeric_feats + cyc_feats]\n",
    "X_test = test_df[numeric_feats + cyc_feats]\n",
    "\n",
    "# Fit STRICTLY on Train\n",
    "pipeline = fit_pipeline_on_train(pipeline, X_train)\n",
    "print('✓ Pipeline fitted on Train only')"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 7. Transform Train & Test"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "X_train_transformed = transform_with_pipeline(pipeline, X_train)\n",
    "X_test_transformed = transform_with_pipeline(pipeline, X_test)\n",
    "\n",
    "print(f'X_train_transformed: {X_train_transformed.shape}')\n",
    "print(f'X_test_transformed: {X_test_transformed.shape}')\n",
    "print('✓ Test transformed using Train-fitted parameters (no leakage)')"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 8. Target transformation diagnostic (log1p candidate)\n",
    "\n",
    "CHỉ diagnostic – KHÔNG kết luận log1p tốt hơn."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "y_train = train_df['pm25']\n",
    "diag = evaluate_log1p_transform(y_train)\n",
    "\n",
    "print(f'Original skew: {diag[\"original_skew\"]:.3f}')\n",
    "print(f'log1p skew:    {diag[\"log1p_skew\"]:.3f}')\n",
    "print(f'Original kurtosis: {diag[\"original_kurtosis\"]:.3f}')\n",
    "print(f'log1p kurtosis:    {diag[\"log1p_kurtosis\"]:.3f}')\n",
    "print('\\n→ Kết luận cuối cùng sẽ dựa trên dữ liệu thực tế sau #5/#6.')"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 9. Integration với Issue #5 (audit trước preprocessing)\n",
    "\n",
    "Reuse `audit_dataframe` và `audit_six_dimensions` từ `data_quality.py`."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Chạy audit từ #5 trên dataset\n",
    "audit_results = run_preprocessing_audit(df_merged, dataset_name='demo_dataset')\n",
    "\n",
    "print('Summary table:')\n",
    "display(audit_results['summary_table'])\n",
    "\n",
    "print('\\nSix dimensions keys:', list(audit_results['six_dimensions']['dimensions'].keys()))"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 10. Leakage validation\n",
    "\n",
    "Kiểm tra pipeline không fit trên Test."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Validate không có leakage\n",
    "validate_no_leakage(pipeline, X_train, X_test)\n",
    "print('✓ Pipeline validated: fitted on Train only, no leakage')"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 11. Freeze dataset with audit\n",
    "\n",
    "Freeze dataset và ghi nhận audit results."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Freeze với audit\n",
    "freeze_info, audit = freeze_dataset_with_audit(df_merged, run_audit=True)\n",
    "\n",
    "print(f'Rows: {freeze_info.row_count}')\n",
    "print(f'Span: {freeze_info.timestamp_min} → {freeze_info.timestamp_max}')\n",
    "print(f'Stations: {freeze_info.station_count}')\n",
    "print(f'Audit recorded: {\"audit\" in freeze_info.additional_info}')"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 12. Export Parquet (snappy)\n",
    "\n",
    "Khi #5/#6 xong, export dataset thật ra `data/processed/air_pollution_final.parquet`."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Demo export – khi #5/#6 xong, thay bằng:\n",
    "# export_to_parquet(df_merged, 'data/processed/air_pollution_final.parquet')\n",
    "\n",
    "import tempfile\n",
    "with tempfile.NamedTemporaryFile(suffix='.parquet', delete=False) as f:\n",
    "    tmp_path = f.name\n",
    "\n",
    "export_to_parquet(df_merged, tmp_path)\n",
    "print(f'✓ Exported and validated: {tmp_path}')\n",
    "\n",
    "# Cleanup\n",
    "import os\n",
    "os.unlink(tmp_path)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
